---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 p-8 text-center mt-auto">
	<div class="container mx-auto">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start">
			<div class="text-left">
				<img src="/stwLogo.jpg" alt="Strong Towns Worcester logo" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-md mb-2" />
				<p class="text-white font-semibold">Strong Towns Worcester</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Building a more resilient, fiscally-sound Worcester.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-left">
				<h4 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Resources</h4>
				<ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
					<li><a href="/about" class="hover:underline">About</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">Strong Towns</a></li>
					<li><a href="#join" class="hover:underline">Get Involved</a></li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="text-left">
				<h4 class="font-semibold text-white mb-2">Connect</h4>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 justify-start">
